{
  "name": "grindstones",
  "normalizations": [
    "At a grindstone: grind a cursed, enchanted iron sword with a repair cost, combine two worn diamond swords (one enchanted), grind an enchanted book, and offer stone, which the grindstone refuses.",
    "Compare the result offered and the inventory after shift-clicking it out and closing: only curses stay, the repair cost is that of the curses, durability adds up with a twentieth more, and a book with nothing left is a plain book. The experience given back is random, so it is not compared.",
